<view class="page"><view class="title">退款处理</view><view class="rule">只做试算与人工确认登记，不连接支付。非消费者原因按优惠权益核对；争议保持待处理，不自动选择少退。利息与更有利约定逐项记录。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载申请…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view class="label">本次审核依据与处理说明（必填）</view><textarea class="field" data-field="note" value="{{note}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="500" placeholder="原因、原始约定、合理价格证据、利息与更有利约定核对结果"/><view wx:if="{{ready&&!refunds.length}}" class="empty">暂无退款申请。</view><view wx:for="{{refunds}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="heading">{{item.target_type==='CARD'?'单张套餐卡':'独立储值本金'}}</view><view class="tag">{{item.statusText}}</view></view><view>顾客编号：{{item.customer_id}}</view><view class="amount">¥ {{item.amountText}}</view><view>{{item.reasonText}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.rule_snapshot}}</view><view class="small muted">说明：{{item.evidence}}</view><view class="small muted">审核：{{item.review_note}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.status==='PENDING'}}"><view wx:if="{{item.reason==='DISPUTED'}}" class="error">原因有争议：保持待处理，先核实双方证据。</view><button wx:if="{{item.reason!=='DISPUTED'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-approve="yes" bindtap="review" disabled="{{busy}}">确认登记 · 不执行付款</button><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-approve="no" bindtap="review" disabled="{{busy}}">退回并保留依据</button></view></view></view>
